on exitFrame
  [  0] pushint8 30 ............................. <30>
  [  2] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [  4] pusharglistnoret 2 ...................... <30, 1>
  [  6] extcall 26 .............................. puppetSprite(30, 1)
  [  8] pushint8 31 ............................. <31>
  [ 10] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 12] pusharglistnoret 2 ...................... <31, 1>
  [ 14] extcall 26 .............................. puppetSprite(31, 1)
